-- ERC-8004 (Trustless Agents): Ethereum agent identity/reputation/validation registries.
-- The reference contracts are already attributed to Ethereum; this gives the standard
-- its own sub-ecosystem so cross-chain 8004 tooling has a home. Repos stay attributed
-- to their chains as before (a repo may belong to several ecosystems).
ecoadd ERC-8004
ecocon Ethereum ERC-8004
repadd ERC-8004 https://github.com/erc-8004/erc-8004-contracts #protocol
repadd ERC-8004 https://github.com/erc-8004/best-practices
repadd ERC-8004 https://github.com/QuantuLabs/8004-solana-ts #library
repadd ERC-8004 https://github.com/cypherpulse/ERC-8004-Trustless-Agents #developer-tool

-- Onchain Agents: umbrella for tooling that builds, pays, identifies or measures
-- autonomous agents transacting on chain. x402 (already in the taxonomy) and ERC-8004
-- are its two standards-shaped sub-ecosystems.
ecoadd "Onchain Agents"
ecocon "Onchain Agents" x402
ecocon "Onchain Agents" ERC-8004

-- Sato Hub index: daily-updated, CC-BY-4.0 catalog of the onchain-agent stack
-- (frameworks, MCP servers, wallets, payment rails, registries) with CITATION.cff.
repadd "Onchain Agents" https://github.com/satohubai/onchain-agents #developer-tool
